{
  "abstract": "Complete Lean 4 formalization disproving the Fanelli-Moscardelli tight threshold conjecture (google-deepmind/formal-conjectures Issue #7848) and determining the exact full-parity rank-improvement stability threshold K(N) = ceil(N/2) - 1 for all N >= 13 (both even N = 2m >= 14 and odd N = 2m - 1 >= 13), together with K(2m) <= m - 1 for all m >= 7.",
